{"seq":3,"slug":"adaptive-layout-navigation","title":"自适应布局与导航","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/ui/adaptive-layout-navigation","wordCount":557,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"自适应布局与导航\">自适应布局与导航</h1><p>跨平台 UI 的核心挑战之一是适配从 4.7 英寸 iPhone SE 到 12.9 英寸 iPad Pro、再到桌面宽屏的巨大屏幕差异。Compose Multiplatform 通过 Material 3 Adaptive 库、Window Size Classes 和自适应导航模式，提供了一套声明式的多尺寸适配方案——用同一份代码根据可用空间自动切换布局结构，而非为每个屏幕尺寸硬编码不同的页面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>自适应布局的设计理念是将屏幕空间抽象为 Window Size Class，然后根据分类选择不同的组件排列策略：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[Window Size Class 检测] --&gt; B{宽度分类}&#10;    B --&gt;|Compact &lt; 600dp| C[单列布局 + 底部导航]&#10;    B --&gt;|Medium 600-840dp| D[双栏布局 + 导航 Rail]&#10;    B --&gt;|Expanded &gt; 840dp| E[三栏布局 + 固定侧边栏]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; F[手机竖屏]&#10;    D --&gt; G[平板竖屏 / 折叠屏]&#10;    E --&gt; H[平板横屏 / 桌面]\">flowchart TD\n    A[Window Size Class 检测] --&gt; B{宽度分类}\n    B --&gt;|Compact &lt; 600dp| C[单列布局 + 底部导航]\n    B --&gt;|Medium 600-840dp| D[双栏布局 + 导航 Rail]\n    B --&gt;|Expanded &gt; 840dp| E[三栏布局 + 固定侧边栏]\n\n    C --&gt; F[手机竖屏]\n    D --&gt; G[平板竖屏 / 折叠屏]\n    E --&gt; H[平板横屏 / 桌面]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Window Size Class</th>\n<th>宽度范围</th>\n<th>典型设备</th>\n<th>导航模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Compact</td>\n<td>&lt; 600dp</td>\n<td>iPhone、Android 手机</td>\n<td>Bottom Navigation</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Medium</td>\n<td>600-840dp</td>\n<td>iPad mini、折叠屏展开</td>\n<td>Navigation Rail</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Expanded</td>\n<td>&gt; 840dp</td>\n<td>iPad Pro、Desktop</td>\n<td>Permanent Drawer</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"window-size-class-检测\">Window Size Class 检测</h2><p>Compose Multiplatform 通过 <code>calculateWindowSizeClass()</code> API 获取当前窗口的尺寸分类：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;@Composable&#10;fun AdaptiveApp() {&#10;    val windowSizeClass = calculateWindowSizeClass()&#10;&#10;    when (windowSizeClass.widthSizeClass) {&#10;        WindowWidthSizeClass.Compact -&gt; CompactLayout()&#10;        WindowWidthSizeClass.Medium -&gt; MediumLayout()&#10;        WindowWidthSizeClass.Expanded -&gt; ExpandedLayout()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun CompactLayout() {&#10;    Scaffold(&#10;        bottomBar = { BottomNavigationBar() }&#10;    ) { padding -&gt;&#10;        NavHost(modifier = Modifier.padding(padding)) {&#10;            // 单屏导航&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun ExpandedLayout() {&#10;    PermanentNavigationDrawer(&#10;        drawerContent = { NavigationDrawerContent() }&#10;    ) {&#10;        // 主内容区域可以进一步分栏&#10;        Row {&#10;            ListPane(modifier = Modifier.weight(0.4f))&#10;            DetailPane(modifier = Modifier.weight(0.6f))&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun AdaptiveApp() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val windowSizeClass = calculateWindowSizeClass()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    when (windowSizeClass.widthSizeClass) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        WindowWidthSizeClass.Compact -> CompactLayout()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        WindowWidthSizeClass.Medium -> MediumLayout()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        WindowWidthSizeClass.Expanded -> ExpandedLayout()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun CompactLayout() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Scaffold(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bottomBar = { BottomNavigationBar() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) { padding -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        NavHost(modifier = Modifier.padding(padding)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 单屏导航</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ExpandedLayout() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    PermanentNavigationDrawer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        drawerContent = { NavigationDrawerContent() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 主内容区域可以进一步分栏</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Row {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ListPane(modifier = Modifier.weight(0.4f))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            DetailPane(modifier = Modifier.weight(0.6f))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"material-3-adaptive-组件\">Material 3 Adaptive 组件</h2><p><code>material3-adaptive</code> 库（<code>org.jetbrains.compose.material3.adaptive:adaptive*</code>）提供了开箱即用的自适应容器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;@Composable&#10;fun AdaptiveListDetail(&#10;    items: List&lt;Item&gt;,&#10;    onItemSelected: (Item) -&gt; Unit,&#10;    selectedItem: Item?&#10;) {&#10;    val navigator = rememberListDetailPaneScaffoldNavigator&lt;Item&gt;()&#10;&#10;    ListDetailPaneScaffold(&#10;        directive = navigator.scaffoldDirective,&#10;        value = navigator.scaffoldValue,&#10;        listPane = {&#10;            AnimatedPane {&#10;                ItemList(&#10;                    items = items,&#10;                    onItemClick = { item -&gt;&#10;                        navigator.navigateTo(ListDetailPaneScaffoldRole.Detail, item)&#10;                    }&#10;                )&#10;            }&#10;        },&#10;        detailPane = {&#10;            AnimatedPane {&#10;                navigator.currentDestination?.content?.let { item -&gt;&#10;                    ItemDetail(item = item)&#10;                } ?: PlaceholderDetail()&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun AdaptiveListDetail(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    items: List&#x3C;Item>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onItemSelected: (Item) -> Unit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    selectedItem: Item?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val navigator = rememberListDetailPaneScaffoldNavigator&#x3C;Item>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ListDetailPaneScaffold(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        directive = navigator.scaffoldDirective,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        value = navigator.scaffoldValue,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        listPane = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AnimatedPane {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                ItemList(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    items = items,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    onItemClick = { item -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        navigator.navigateTo(ListDetailPaneScaffoldRole.Detail, item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        detailPane = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AnimatedPane {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                navigator.currentDestination?.content?.let { item -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    ItemDetail(item = item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                } ?: PlaceholderDetail()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个组件在 Compact 屏幕上表现为全屏列表 → 点击进入详情（push navigation），在 Expanded 屏幕上则自动变为左右分栏（list-detail layout），无需额外代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自适应导航模式\">自适应导航模式</h2><p>导航组件本身也需要根据屏幕尺寸切换形态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;@Composable&#10;fun AdaptiveNavigationScaffold(&#10;    destinations: List&lt;NavigationDestination&gt;,&#10;    selectedIndex: Int,&#10;    onNavigate: (Int) -&gt; Unit,&#10;    content: @Composable () -&gt; Unit&#10;) {&#10;    val windowSizeClass = calculateWindowSizeClass()&#10;&#10;    when (windowSizeClass.widthSizeClass) {&#10;        WindowWidthSizeClass.Compact -&gt; {&#10;            Scaffold(&#10;                bottomBar = {&#10;                    NavigationBar {&#10;                        destinations.forEachIndexed { index, dest -&gt;&#10;                            NavigationBarItem(&#10;                                icon = { Icon(dest.icon, contentDescription = dest.label) },&#10;                                label = { Text(dest.label) },&#10;                                selected = index == selectedIndex,&#10;                                onClick = { onNavigate(index) }&#10;                            )&#10;                        }&#10;                    }&#10;                }&#10;            ) { padding -&gt; Box(Modifier.padding(padding)) { content() } }&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        WindowWidthSizeClass.Medium -&gt; {&#10;            Row {&#10;                NavigationRail {&#10;                    destinations.forEachIndexed { index, dest -&gt;&#10;                        NavigationRailItem(&#10;                            icon = { Icon(dest.icon, contentDescription = dest.label) },&#10;                            label = { Text(dest.label) },&#10;                            selected = index == selectedIndex,&#10;                            onClick = { onNavigate(index) }&#10;                        )&#10;                    }&#10;                }&#10;                Box(Modifier.weight(1f)) { content() }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        WindowWidthSizeClass.Expanded -&gt; {&#10;            PermanentNavigationDrawer(&#10;                drawerContent = {&#10;                    PermanentDrawerSheet {&#10;                        destinations.forEachIndexed { index, dest -&gt;&#10;                            NavigationDrawerItem(&#10;                                icon = { Icon(dest.icon, contentDescription = dest.label) },&#10;                                label = { Text(dest.label) },&#10;                                selected = index == selectedIndex,&#10;                                onClick = { onNavigate(index) }&#10;                            )&#10;                        }&#10;                    }&#10;                }&#10;            ) { content() }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun AdaptiveNavigationScaffold(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    destinations: List&#x3C;NavigationDestination>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    selectedIndex: Int,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onNavigate: (Int) -> Unit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    content: @Composable () -> Unit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val windowSizeClass = calculateWindowSizeClass()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    when (windowSizeClass.widthSizeClass) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        WindowWidthSizeClass.Compact -> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Scaffold(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                bottomBar = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    NavigationBar {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        destinations.forEachIndexed { index, dest -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            NavigationBarItem(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                icon = { Icon(dest.icon, contentDescription = dest.label) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                label = { Text(dest.label) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                selected = index == selectedIndex,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                onClick = { onNavigate(index) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ) { padding -> Box(Modifier.padding(padding)) { content() } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        WindowWidthSizeClass.Medium -> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Row {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                NavigationRail {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    destinations.forEachIndexed { index, dest -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        NavigationRailItem(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            icon = { Icon(dest.icon, contentDescription = dest.label) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            label = { Text(dest.label) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            selected = index == selectedIndex,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            onClick = { onNavigate(index) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Box(Modifier.weight(1f)) { content() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        WindowWidthSizeClass.Expanded -> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            PermanentNavigationDrawer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                drawerContent = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    PermanentDrawerSheet {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        destinations.forEachIndexed { index, dest -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            NavigationDrawerItem(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                icon = { Icon(dest.icon, contentDescription = dest.label) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                label = { Text(dest.label) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                selected = index == selectedIndex,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                onClick = { onNavigate(index) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ) { content() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Compact&#10;        A[BottomNav] --&gt; B[Full Screen]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Medium&#10;        C[Rail] --&gt; D[Content Area]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Expanded&#10;        E[Drawer] --&gt; F[List] --&gt; G[Detail]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Compact\n        A[BottomNav] --&gt; B[Full Screen]\n    end\n    subgraph Medium\n        C[Rail] --&gt; D[Content Area]\n    end\n    subgraph Expanded\n        E[Drawer] --&gt; F[List] --&gt; G[Detail]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"折叠屏与多窗口\">折叠屏与多窗口</h2><p>Compose Multiplatform 通过 <code>WindowInfoTracker</code> 支持折叠屏设备的物理折叠感知：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain（使用 window-core 库）&#10;@Composable&#10;fun FoldAwareLayout(content: @Composable () -&gt; Unit) {&#10;    val foldingFeatures = calculateFoldingFeatures()&#10;&#10;    val tableTopMode = foldingFeatures.any { feature -&gt;&#10;        feature is FoldingFeature &amp;&amp;&#10;        feature.state == FoldingFeature.State.HALF_OPENED &amp;&amp;&#10;        feature.orientation == FoldingFeature.Orientation.HORIZONTAL&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (tableTopMode) {&#10;        // 桌面模式：上半屏显示内容，下半屏显示控制&#10;        Column {&#10;            Box(Modifier.weight(1f)) { ContentView() }&#10;            Box(Modifier.weight(1f)) { ControlPanel() }&#10;        }&#10;    } else {&#10;        content()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain（使用 window-core 库）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun FoldAwareLayout(content: @Composable () -> Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val foldingFeatures = calculateFoldingFeatures()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val tableTopMode = foldingFeatures.any { feature -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        feature is FoldingFeature &#x26;&#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        feature.state == FoldingFeature.State.HALF_OPENED &#x26;&#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        feature.orientation == FoldingFeature.Orientation.HORIZONTAL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (tableTopMode) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 桌面模式：上半屏显示内容，下半屏显示控制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Column {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Box(Modifier.weight(1f)) { ContentView() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Box(Modifier.weight(1f)) { ControlPanel() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        content()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"响应式设计最佳实践\">响应式设计最佳实践</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>实践</th>\n<th>反模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>流式布局</td>\n<td>使用 <code>weight</code>、<code>fillMaxWidth</code></td>\n<td>硬编码像素宽度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>断点切换</td>\n<td>基于 WindowSizeClass 切换结构</td>\n<td>基于具体设备型号判断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容优先</td>\n<td>小屏先设计核心体验</td>\n<td>大屏设计缩小到手机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渐进增强</td>\n<td>大屏增加信息密度</td>\n<td>大屏只是放大手机版</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Window Size Class 将屏幕空间抽象为 Compact/Medium/Expanded 三级</li>\n<li>Material 3 Adaptive 提供 ListDetailPaneScaffold 等自动适配容器</li>\n<li>导航组件根据屏幕宽度自动切换 BottomNav/Rail/Drawer 形态</li>\n<li>折叠屏通过 FoldingFeature API 感知物理折叠状态</li>\n<li>自适应设计遵循&quot;流式布局 + 断点切换 + 内容优先&quot;原则</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"compose-multiplatform-fundamentals\">Compose Multiplatform 基础</a>——Compose 的跨平台渲染和状态管理基础</li>\n<li><a href=\"compose-ios-integration\">Compose 与 iOS 平台整合</a>——iOS 上的特殊适配需求</li>\n<li><a href=\"../android-development/jetpack-compose/navigation-compose\">Android 开发：Navigation Compose</a>——Android 端导航的深度用法</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自适应布局与导航","id":"自适应布局与导航"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Window Size Class 检测","id":"window-size-class-检测"},{"level":2,"text":"Material 3 Adaptive 组件","id":"material-3-adaptive-组件"},{"level":2,"text":"自适应导航模式","id":"自适应导航模式"},{"level":2,"text":"折叠屏与多窗口","id":"折叠屏与多窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"响应式设计最佳实践","id":"响应式设计最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Compose 与 iOS 平台整合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/ui/compose-ios-integration"},"next":{"title":"Kotlin Toolchain 与构建配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/engineering/kotlin-toolchain-build"}}